---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Getting started with Decant" description="Learn how to turn any article or web page into a clean Markdown note with Decant." canonicalPath="/welcome.html">
  <Header />
  <main class="reading-page shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">Getting started</p><h1>Three steps to a<br /><em>better reading habit.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Decant is designed to stay out of your way. Install it, open a page, and keep the useful part.</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><span>01</span><div><h2>Install the extension</h2><p>Install Decant from the browser store or build it from the open-source repository. Pin it to your toolbar for easy access.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>02</span><div><h2>Open something worth keeping</h2><p>Visit an article, guide, recipe, paper, or documentation page. Decant works on the page you are already reading.</p></div></li>
      <li><span>03</span><div><h2>Decant it into Markdown</h2><p>Click the extension, review the extracted content, and export a clean note to your downloads or knowledge base.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
    <div class="callout"><strong>Privacy note</strong><p>Decant performs extraction in your browser. The website uses lightweight analytics, but the extension does not upload the pages you clip.</p></div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
